WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.480
Lucky! They only make ten of these crêpes each day!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.820
Time to have a tas—

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.700
Outta my way!

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.240
Ouch!

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.200
Hurry! They're coming!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.080
There they are!

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.540
Exit stage left!

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.460
What about my crêpe?!

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.960
Thanks, Fortune!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.430
What?

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.010
You've got some nerve!

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.140
Yeah, for a shoplifter!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.680
Shoplifter?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.850
We'll hear the rest at the station.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.060
Who you think you're fucking with?!

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.980
Don't you dare ruin my wonderful luck with your retarded misunderstandings!

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.900
This is obstruction of justice!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.450
What?!

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.240
Stop right there!

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:02.200
Before you preach to others about luck, try lookin' at yourself in the mirror.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.710
Your arms should be embracing others,

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.710
and yet right now they're cryin' out in pain.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.840
A girl should never raise her hand in anger.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.680
You'd be lettin' that precious luck of yours get away from you,

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.640
li'l miss.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:18.800
Huh?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.400
What...

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.610
the hell?

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.940
Friend of yours?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.280
No way... This is the first time I've seen—

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.120
Please listen to me, officers!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.780
I did steal those things! I'm sorry!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.120
I was forced to! I said I didn't want to do it!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.870
But I was threatened... by that person!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.420
So you're behind all this!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.380
That's playing dirty!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.880
Hey, what the hell?!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.380
Arrest the perpetrator!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.140
We'll need your testim—

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.140
She's gone!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.640
That bitch!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.810
You're gonna pay for this!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.140
Freedom is sweet!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.200
<i>I wonder what happened after that.</i>

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.950
<i>She must've been furious.</i>

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.410
<i>Oh well, not like I'll ever see her again.</i>

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.280
All right,

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.790
time to introduce you all to a new transfer student.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.170
Teacher, don't you think our class has a few too many transfer students?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:57.210
Ah, that's only because it's the main character's class.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:58.880
He said it...

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.210
Come on in!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.390
Uh... Rindou... That's a boy's name, right?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.270
Not at all!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.730
I'm Rindou Ranmaru!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.560
Nice to meet you!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.310
My hobby is karate!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:19.650
My dream is to revive my father's karate dojo that had to close due to financial difficulties!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:23.070
So this is that thing that happens when you raise a girl as a guy?

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.780
Don't you dare try to classify me.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.780
Or would you like me to carve some of that fat away?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.080
I'm sorry.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.580
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.080
<i>There's no way she's forgotten me yet!</i>

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.210
<i>I got it! I just need a disguise!</i>

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.170
This should do it!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.140
I won't be outdone! Challenge accepted!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.260
Don't copy me, you goddamn hobo!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.060
This just makes us stand out even more!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.310
<i>Is this some new trend?</i>

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.730
You too?!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.190
Your seat's on the corridor side, in the back row.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:04:59.980
Roger.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.700
<i>The hell's going on?</i>

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.070
Hey, I remember you from yesterday!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.660
<i>No way! She found out in a flash!</i>

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.450
Hey, look me in the eye!

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.830
Ouch!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.830
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.340
Rindou was hurting me!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.300
Eh?

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.880
What did you do to Sakura?!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:23.710
No, I—

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.260
I don't care if you're a girl! You can't do this!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.220
Yeah!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.590
But I didn't do—

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.100
You fucker!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.890
<i>That bitch is gonna pay!</i>

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:40.020
<i>But thanks to her "bodyguards", I can't do shit at this school...</i>

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.490
Yes?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.120
Nothing to see here, move along.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.710
Like fuck you didn't see that!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.000
How the hell did you get in here?!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.460
With focused spirit and grim determination!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.630
Sakura Ichiko's residence! Here we are at Sakura Ichiko's residence!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.800
And here you can see the rare Holstein cow, Sakura Ichiko!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.260
So it was <i>you</i>, beggar bitch?!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.050
Quit bringing me trouble!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.550
Who're you callin' trouble?!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:12.890
You know,

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:17.810
I detest people who dump the blame on others and make them take the fall!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.400
Don't you ever get tired of runnin', coward?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.270
You think you can preach to <i>me</i> after breaking down my friggin' door?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.150
You gender-confused dyke!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.530
Dyke?!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.150
Don't let her get the better of you! Say something!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.360
S-Screw you, cow-tits!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.160
Oh. That's not much of an insult.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.200
Why, thank you!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.790
Is that all you've got to say, muscle chick?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.460
You wanna have that fat carved away?!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.250
Oh, my button.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:50.090
Dumbass! Did you think you could beat my luck?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.720
By the way, she's human.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.350
Listen up, bitch!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.690
You'll fucking pay for this, Sakura Ichiko!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.440
Fight me, one on one!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.020
Why don't you take her up on that?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.440
Why is she alive again? We're thirteen floors up.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.820
Sakura's gonna fight the transfer student?

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.490
What's going on?!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.160
Why's it gotta be like this?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.160
200 yen on Sakura!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.540
50,000 on Rindou!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.830
Coke and popcorn! How about a beer?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.130
Tsuwabuki, you'll get in trouble for the beer.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.880
Don't worry, even the teachers are buying it.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:29.800
Sakura! If you win, I'll do whatever you say.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.590
Nice to see you're confident.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.140
In that case, if I win you'll have to leave the school.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.850
Fine with me.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.430
That is, <i>if</i> you can win!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.850
My parents gave me this girl's body,

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.150
but I've tempered it with courage and spirit!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.150
This coat is my best and only suit!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.900
The name's Rindou! Rindou Ranmaru!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.620
You got a real mean streak to you, bitch.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.660
Time to beat it outta you! Get ready!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.040
Take this!

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:07.210
Ryuuran Kick!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.460
Get her, Rindou!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.050
Hey, Akane, you've got a piece of thread in your hair.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.010
No way, where?!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.430
My eyes!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.220
Goddamn, my foot's stuck!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.400
Ouch! I give! Uncle!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.860
Whoops, I guess I won!

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:28.690
Down in one blow!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.400
Sakura, you're awesome!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.150
Man, it was over so quickly.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.620
They could've at least done it like a Yuusuke-Yomi fight.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.330
You mean, 60 hours long?

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.990
How much did you make?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.290
All in all, ten thousand.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.410
That's great.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.750
Now I can afford some new gadgets!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:48.630
Just wait for me!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.000
Today we dinin' well!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:55.380
Fuck! How could I lose to that bitch?!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.390
Hey.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.010
Good job. You were pretty cool.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.140
It was a good match.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.140
The next time you're planning a fight, let me know.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.650
<i>I'll be there to sell stuff.</i>

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.650
O-Okay...

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.860
Um, wh-what's your name?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.490
Tsuwabuki Keita.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.070
Hinketsumura Momiji.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.450
No one asked <i>you</i>.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.330
He's so cool!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.500
By the way!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.420
Remember our little pre-fight agreement?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.420
Got it.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.680
As promised, I'll leave the school.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:43.970
<i>And that's how this hot-blooded dumbass,
born into entirely the wrong era, left the school.</i>

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.980
Time to introduce you all to a new transfer student.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:48.850
And...

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.690
She was back right away!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.740
She left once, so she transferred back again. Rindou Ranmaru.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.570
My purpose in life is to defeat Sakura Ichiko!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.990
I should've told her to get out of my life forever.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:06.000
I think this is the beginning of a beautiful friendship!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.390
Are you hurt?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.520
We're fine! Thank you!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.560
<i>Damn, if I can take down these guys without even breaking a sweat...</i>

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:33.360
Why can't I win against Sakura Ichiko?!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.030
So, let's fight again!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.540
Huh? I don't wanna.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.920
Who cares what <i>you</i> want?!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.080
You think you can just get away with this?!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.050
Stop! Why do you hate me so much?!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.550
Stop right there!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.130
Know when to give up, Rindou!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.140
We won't let you lay another finger on Sakura!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.100
Shut up, guys!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.470
Why are you so head-over-heels for Sakura all the time?!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.520
Go on, Rindou! Chop 'em to pieces!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.810
Shut yer trap!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.310
Don't get other people to do your dirty work!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.900
Shut up! What do—

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.610
Stop, everyone!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.610
Any more fighting would be pointless.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:18.940
Because...

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.530
We'll be holding Rindou Ranmaru's comeback fight very soon!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.160
What are you doing?!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:25.830
Sounds great!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.040
Hey, don't just decide without me!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.370
Tickets on sale!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.000
Kids, cut it out already!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.340
Shut up.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.130
I'm trying to sleep!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.960
I'm sorry.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:43.220
Yeah, pipe down when someone's trying to get a little shut-eye.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.640
You could at least pretend to listen to me...

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.600
<i>I can't handle this.</i>

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.160
What the hell am I thinking?!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.660
I should be thinking about how to beat Sakura Ichiko!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.540
And...

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.000
I've got no chance looking like this.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.580
Oh ho!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.630
Oh ho!

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.460
Y-Y-You?!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.250
Did you hear that?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:19.840
Crystal clear!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.470
Wh-Wh-What is it?!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:24.680
You're a girl...

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.220
just like us!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.180
What... are you even... talking...

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:34.190
"One day, I wanna dress like that and flirt with my handsome boyfriend!"

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.730
Stop tryin' to read my mind!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.310
I didn't even say that, anyway!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.780
Don't worry! I can make your wish come true.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.110
Huh? Why would you?

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.780
Don't you get it?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.410
We're rivals who even came to blows with each other!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.620
Can you really say that what we forged in the heat of battle is anything but...

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.580
the bonds of friendship?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.370
Friend... ship?!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.080
Just leave it to me. I won't harm you.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.840
Really?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.470
<i>This is why I love dealing with impulsive dumbasses like you!</i>

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:11.520
<i>I'll see that you pay for all the crap you put me through 'til now!</i>

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.770
<i>I can see right through you, Sakura Ichiko!</i>

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:18.270
<i>I'll make her take my side, and the two of us will strike when you least expect it!</i>

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.780
<i>We'll rob you of your Fortune together!</i>

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.840
Okay, done!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.180
Amazing! This truly is a miracle!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.890
Holy crap! Is that me?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.310
How does it feel to be reborn?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.390
<i>I'm still cuter, though.</i>

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:57.940
Though, to put it simply...

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.060
Lay off the weed!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.690
My thighs feel so breezy.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.020
Don't lift your skirt!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.860
It's easier to walk in sandals.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:04.780
Don't be picky!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.860
Such a pain in the ass...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.700
Hey, she's real cute!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.530
What's wrong?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.000
<i>That was the first time in my life
someone's ever called me cute!</i>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.090
Now all you need is a boyfriend, and it's perfect!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.300
<i>A boyfriend...</i>

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.380
Hey!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.970
Nah, that's still pretty far away.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.260
For now, I'm happy just getting this makeover.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.680
Sakura, Binboda,

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.770
I'll never forget today.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.020
Thanks.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.770
But, I should change back before going home,

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.480
or who knows what my dad's gonna say...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.440
Your dad?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:53.200
My dad wanted a son to inherit his dojo,

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.700
but all he got was a daughter. Me.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.580
He decided to turn me into the best female karate fighter in Japan.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.210
He's an even bigger fan of karate than I am.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.380
So it's your dad's fault that you're so boyish?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.340
Don't refer to it as his "fault"!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:13.010
Sure, it may be tough at times,

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:17.560
but I really respect him for having raised me all alone.

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.730
Eh, I don't get that.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
That whole thing about having to respect your parents.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.400
What's wrong with her?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:27.860
Who knows?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.910
<i>Should I get changed now?</i>

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.780
<i>Nah, not yet.</i>

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.750
<i>I want to enjoy this for just a little longer.</i>

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:40.750
Ranmaru.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.170
Good morning, Sakura!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.750
Good morning, boys!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.310
Hey, where are your clothes from yesterday?

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.770
And what happened to your face?!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.890
Did your father—

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.770
Shut yer trap.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.020
It's none of your damn business.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.770
Just leave me alone.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.780
Are you going to Ranmaru's place?

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.290
She told you to leave her alone.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:26.080
It's not nice to meddle in other people's private lives.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.130
<i>You</i> sure as hell can talk!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.670
Stand, Ranmaru!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.220
You're breaking your father's heart!

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.560
When did you become such a weakling?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.480
How could you be led astray by trash like this?

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.310
Wait! Dad!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:51.900
If something this mundane is all it takes to throw you off,

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.320
how can you possibly expect to become a karate champion?

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.620
Sakura!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.540
Sakura?

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.130
Are you that classmate of Ranmaru's? The one who defeated her?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.050
Yes.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:14.340
And I'm also the one who dressed her up as a girl.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.220
What?

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.090
Listen to me, and listen well.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.680
There are two things in this world that I hate more than anything else.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.980
One is that God of Misfortune.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.680
Hey!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.190
And the other is...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.310
parents who don't care about their children's own happiness,

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.820
and just force their own ideals onto them instead!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.440
Fight me!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.950
If I win, let Rindou have her way!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.450
Sakura?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.950
It's clear she's no match for him in strength.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:47.710
Does she expect to win through luck alone?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.380
That's not what I was expecting to hear from you after breaking down my fence.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.720
It's against my principles to fight a child, especially a girl.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.800
You're running away?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.880
But...

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.140
You certainly are an ill-natured woman,

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.640
and it <i>is</i> my duty as an adult

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.310
to correct your horrible manners!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:08.810
I'll fight you, girl! Prepare yourself!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.230
Stop, Dad! Stop!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.690
Take this!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:19.070
Ryuugen Kick!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.410
My eyes!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.040
Holy crap.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.580
Goddamn it!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.380
Don't think you've won yet, girl!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.600
She smiled.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:50.190
She put on a skirt and some make-up, and did her hair.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.900
She was smiling happily.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.320
You don't even know that!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:00.320
You've got no right to steal away

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:04.700
her happiness!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.540
Rin... dou?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.340
Stop.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:21.300
You know nothing about my dad.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.930
He might just be an annoying adult to you,

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:29.520
but he's the only parent I have!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.310
So... So...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.610
Listen, Sakura!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.860
Don't hurt my dad.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.120
I did tell you not to get involved.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.620
Shut up.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.120
You reap what you sow.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:59.010
If Suwano was here, he'd comfort you by saying that you did it for Ranmaru.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.130
Too bad he isn't.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.740
Dad?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.870
I'm off.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.540
Her name was Sakura Ichiko, right?

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:34.420
There aren't many people who are so willing to throw themselves into danger for someone else.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.170
You've made a good friend, Ranmaru.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.180
She isn't even my friend.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.010
So you're still dressed like that?

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.390
Yeah.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:55.150
Dad said I can dress however I want.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.150
But, y'know, I'm more comfortable in this.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.820
Sakura, sorry about yesterday.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:05.410
I realized that I'm happy enough the way I am.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.330
Thanks. My dad says thanks too.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.660
I know, right?!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.130
There's no way I'd make a mistake!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.210
Whoa, she bounced back quickly!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.170
Sorry, she's always like this!

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.720
Now it's time to hold another Ichiko-fest!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:29.970
Come on, praise me! Hooray! Hooray!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.940
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga!</i>

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.110
Sorry to keep you waiting, dear viewers!

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:06.780
Did you catch me this episode?

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.900
Even if that certain event that happens once every four years is over,

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:11.610
my valued contributions to the show will continue!

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:14.700
This week I was here! And there!

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.950
And now, something special for you!

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:19.910
The first <i>Sukeno ga</i>!

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:22.170
And now, by popular demand,

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:25.960
here's a voice clip from the writer himself!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:26.880
Seriously?

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.880
Seriously! Let's take advantage of this amazing opportunity to listen to it once again!

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:30.630
Seriously?

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.970
And finally, accompanying a picture of none other than the writer himself...

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.180
Seriously?
